# Orpheus CLI

This directory will contain the TypeScript-based CLI for Orpheus.

The legacy Python CLI has been archived to `archived/python-cli/`.

## Planned Stack
- TypeScript
- Node.js
- React Ink (for TUI components)
- Commander.js or similar CLI framework

## Status
Not yet implemented - coming soon after daemon restructuring is complete.
